Thanks for that Tony.

Also note that this new version of rattle will prompt you when it
finds a package that is not installed, so the

dependencies=c("Depends", "Suggests")

is no loner required - try just:

> install.packages("rattle")
> install.packages("RGtk2")
> library(rattle)
> rattle()

(The extra install step for RGtk2 won;t be required in the next
release of rattle).

Regards,
Graham

